From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:36:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rogue Gouges the second attacker (Ability on_add)
 (F-219)

- Ability on_add: cast on another live attacker in melee reach, never the
  kill target, only when one exists (faces it for the cast)
- rogue: Gouge (1776) on the add every 10 s - 4 s out of the fight

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
